opened an Xterm and typed "df".  Here is what I got:

Filesystem    512-blocks    Capacity    Mounted On
/dev/rz0a       126,462        84%        /
/proc              0          100%        /proc
/dev/rz0g     1,603,526        76%        /usr
/dev/rz1c     8,131,716         7%        /Users

Does this help at all?  I assume the system disk has  
several partitions (at least a and g -- I don't know where  
