Have a close look at the fine print on the CDs themselves.  One piece of 
text says that duplication is authorized only after a valid written license
is obtained from Digital.  I interpret this to be a license different from the
licenses you get to run the software.

So it sounds like you need to make a special arrangement with Digital to do 
this.

|>2. Which software can be used. As far as the Layered SW CD:s are
|>   concerned they have (if I remember right) ISO9660 filesystems and
|>   could therefore with no big problems be copied using most CD
|>   mastering software. The install disks (and maybe the firmware
