failure). I have looked at all the nameserver files. None have changed for
several weeks (when I added a virtual domain name). I have contacted
ROOT@WATSON.IBM.COM and he is baffeled as well.

Has anyone else experienced this?

Thanks for you time!   -Andy Saylor, ComSource Inc.



