We have recently installed an Alphastation 600 5/333 and in general we 
are very happy with it. It came with 128Mb of Digital memory and we have 
increased this to 192Mb with 64 megs of third party memory. All chips 
are marked as being 60ns memory, but the firmware reports that the third 
party memory is slow!

