vi'd and more'd through the gcc 2.7.2 source tree, looking for some
reference to libm or -lm, with no results.  I would dearly love to
build a second version of g++, but can't find the place(s) to change!


I've lived with this bug for several years, and have finally lost my
patience with a stupid namespace conflict.  Any information is greatly
appreciated.

