  I believe the current ASA-I firmware (drive assemblies ending in -001)
is 0022 and the current ASA-II firmware (drive assemblies ending in -101)
is 0021. There were a bunch of changes between 0014 and these releases,
some of which do include fixes for bus errors during error recovery sit-
uations.

