In article <1996May6.165118.16175@isac.hces.com> timw@isac.hces.com (Timothy M. Wieman) writes:
TMW> Martin Hannigan (hannigan@shore.net) wrote:
>> In article <4lt1oa$294@random.tpgi.com.au>,
>> dhinkle <dhinkle@tpgi.com.au> wrote:
>> >Does anyone know how to make the c shell display the current directory
>> >in the prompt, and change the prompt as you change directories.

