Have you created the device files for your tape drive and root disk?

The following should work (assuming single tape drive at device tz6 and
root partition is rz0a - substitute as required...!)

cd /dev
MAKEDEV tz6
MAKEDEV rz0a
newfs <file system switches> /dev/rz0a <disk information>
mount /dev/rz0a /mnt
cd /mnt
restore -vr

Hope this helps!

-- 
Warren Oldroyd



