>tar cvf - /stuff | rsh "system" (cd dir; dd of=tar.file)
>
>this has worked in the past, yet when i tried the reverse to restore
>the data, i got a response asking for the second volume about halfway
>through the restore.
>
>thanks in advance for any help.
