The DHPC Project is investigating the use of Telstra's recently
commissioned Experimental Broadband Network (EBN) to connect high
performance computing platforms around Australia. We will evaluate the
network, processor and data storage issues that define the
effectiveness of such a configuration, and design and build innovative
