cities; this project is the first of its kind in Australia and
involves many challenging research problems in distributed
computation.

DHPC is an RDN CRC project administered by ACSys and is co-located at
the University of Adelaide laboratories of the South Australian Centre
for Parallel Computing, and at the Australian National University in
Canberra. For information about the ACSys and RDN CRCs, and the
extensive facilities available to this project (including two
