> % grep -i mach_assert.h /usr/.smdb./*.inv

The include file is used for kernel builds only.  You can find it in
/sys/HOSTNAME/mach_assert.h.  It is used to enable assertions in kernel
code and is typically turned on in the configuration files as:

options	MACH_ASSERT

Turning it on may cause build failures and is not of much use unless you
have sources which has assertions that gets built during a doconfig.

--shashi



